    "circle entries describe richer, more active community & extracurricular ecosystems (parent/PTA/booster involvement, alumni networks, business/nonprofit mentoring, robust arts/athletics) than square entries": "This groups all descriptions of external and in-school community life and extra‑curricular richness (strong booster/PTA presence, alumni/networks, notable arts/athletics and external partnerships) which are about breadth and vitality of activities and community supports, not about staff governance, student-safety crises, or formal academic outcome metrics."
